    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi abaza ati, “Hakyaliho ow'eka ya Shauli asigaireho nkagira ekyo namugilira aha rwa Yonatani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaba haliyo omwiru w'omu ka ya Shauli eibaralye Ziba; bamwetera Omukama Daudi, yamubaza ati, “Iwe niwe Ziba?” Ahorora ati, “Omwiru wawe niwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama ashuba amubaza ati, “Takiliyo muntu asigaireyo ow'eka ya Shauli nkaija nkagira ekyo namugilira aha rwa Ruhanga?” Ziba amugarukamu ati, “Haliyo mutabani wa Yonatani alemaire amaguru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama amubaza ati, “Ali nkahai?” Ziba amushubamu ati, “Ali Lodebari omwa Makiri eya Amieli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Daudi nikwo kutuma bakamwihya Lodebari omwa Makiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agya owa Daudi, amujumara omu maisho amuramya. Daudi amweta ati, “Mefibosheti!” Ogu ayetaba ati, “N'inye omwiru wawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi amugambira ati, “Otatina, kuba ndakugilira ekisha aha rwa Yonatani sho, nkugaruliire n'amataka gona ga Shauli shwenkuru. Kandi orata nolya aha kiihuro kyange ebiro byona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mefibosheti amwinamira, agamba ati, “Omwiru wawe yab'ohai, iwe kumwijukayo, embwa efire nka inye?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma Omukama ayeta Ziba omwiru wa Shauli amugambira ati, “Byona ebyabaire bili bya Shauli n'ekaye nabiha mutabani wa Mukama wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi iwe na batabani bawe n'abairu bawe mumulimire emisiri. Amagesha mugamuletere abone ekyakulya. Kandi ebiro byona arata kulya aha kiihuro kyange.” Ziba hakaba aina abatabani 15 n'abairu 20. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho agambira Omukama ati, “Rugaba Mukama wange, ebyo wandagira byona ndabikora.” Aho Mefibosheti ashusha omwana w'Omukama, ata kulya aha kiihuro kya Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mefibosheti hakaba aina omutabani muto eibaralye Mika. Kandi ab'omwa Ziba bona bahinduka bairu ba Mefibosheti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mefibosheti atura atyo Yerusalemu, kuba ebiro byona yalyaga aha kiihuro ky'Omukama. Akaba alemaire amaguru gombili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
